hadiths[36]{hadithnumber,text}:
"531","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beti ne Aap ki taraf bheja ke mera ek beta faut hone wala hai, to hamare paas aayiye. Phir Aap ne salam kehla bheja aur farmaya: Beshak Allah ka hai jo Us ne liya aur Us ka hai jo Us ne diya. Aur har cheez Us ke paas muqarrar muddat se hai. To use chahiye ke sabr kare aur sawab ki ummeed rakhe. Phir unhon ne Aap ki taraf bheja, Aap ko qasam dete hue ke Aap zaroor un ke paas aayenge. Phir Aap khade hue jabke Aap ke sath Sa'd bin Ubada, Muadh bin Jabal, Ubayy bin Ka'b, Zaid bin Thabit aur chand mard they. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas bachcha uthaya gaya jabke us ki jaan ukhad rahi thi goya mashkeeza hai. Phir Aap ki dono aankhein behne lagein. To Sa'd ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Ye kya hai? To Aap ne farmaya: Ye rehem hai jo Allah ne apne bandon ke dilon mein rakha hai. Aur Allah apne bandon mein se rehem karne walon par hi rehem farmata hai."
"532","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sa'd bin Ubada ko apni ek bimari hui. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) un ki ayadat ke liye un ke paas tashreef laye, Abd al-Rahman bin Auf, Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas aur Abdullah bin Mas'ud ke sath. Phir jab Aap un ke paas dakhil hue to unhe un ke ghar walon ki behoshi mein paya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo faut ho gaye? Unhon ne arz kiya: Nahi Ya Rasulullah! Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) roye. Phir jab qaum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka rona dekha to wo roye. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi sunte? Beshak Allah aankh ke aansu aur dil ke gham se azab nahi deta. Lekin is se azab deta hai, aur Aap ne apni zaban ki taraf ishara farmaya, ya rehem farmata hai. Aur beshak maiyat ko us ke ghar walon ke rone se azab diya jata hai."
"533","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek aurat ke paas se guzre jo qabr ke paas ro rahi thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Allah se daro aur sabr karo. Us ne kaha: Mujh se door ho jao, kyunke tumhe meri museebat nahi pahunchi. Aur unhon ne Aap ko na pehchana. Phir us se kaha gaya: Beshak ye Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hain. Phir wo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke darwaze par aayi aur Aap ke paas darban na paye. To us ne arz kiya: Main ne tumhe na pehchana. To Aap ne farmaya: Sabr to pehli chot par hai."
"534","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Maiyat ko us ki qabr mein us noha se azab diya jata hai jo us par kiya jaye."
"535","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab se Abu Musa ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Umar (raziyallahu anhu) zakhmi hue to Suhaib kehne lage: Haaye mere bhai! To Umar ne farmaya: Kya tum nahi jante ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak maiyat ko zinda ke rone se azab diya jata hai."
"536","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar, Umar aur Aisha se Abdullah bin Ubaidullah bin Abi Mulaika ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Usman (raziyallahu anhu) ki ek beti Makkah mein faut ho gayi. Aur hum us mein hazir hone aaye. Aur us mein Ibn Umar aur Ibn Abbas hazir they. Aur beshak main un dono ke darmiyan baitha tha [ya kaha ke main un mein se ek ke paas baitha phir doosra aaya aur mere pehlu mein baitha]. Phir Abdullah bin Umar ne Amr bin Usman se kaha: Kya tum rone se manع nahi karte? Kyunke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak maiyat ko us ke ghar walon ke rone se azab diya jata hai. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Umar (raziyallahu anhu) is mein se kuchh kehte they. Phir bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Makkah se nikla. Yahan tak ke jab hum Baida mein they to wo kekar ke darakht ke saye ke neeche ek qafile ko dekhte. To unhon ne farmaya: Jao aur dekho ye qafila kaun hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne dekha to Suhaib they. Phir main ne unhe khabar di. To unhon ne farmaya: Use mere liye bulao. Phir main Suhaib ki taraf lauta aur kaha: Kooch karo aur Amir al-Muminin se milo. Phir jab Umar zakhmi hue to Suhaib rote hue dakhil hue kehte: Haaye mere bhai, haaye mere sathi! Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Ae Suhaib! Kya tum mujh par rote ho jabke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya hai: Beshak maiyat ko us ke ghar walon ke kuchh rone se azab diya jata hai. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Phir jab Umar (raziyallahu anhu) faut ho gaye to main ne is ka Aisha se zikr kiya. To unhon ne farmaya: Allah Umar par rehem farmaye. Allah ki qasam! Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye bayan nahi farmaya ke beshak Allah momin ko us ke ghar walon ke rone se azab deta hai. Lekin Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah kafir ka us ke ghar walon ke rone se azab badhata hai. Aur unhon ne kaha: Tumhe Quran kafi hai [aur koi bojh uthane wali kisi aur ka bojh nahi uthayegi]. Ibn Abbas ne us waqt kaha: Aur Allah hi hansata aur rulata hai. Ibn Abi Mulaika ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ibn Umar ne kuchh na kaha."
"537","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha aur Ibn Umar se Urwa ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aisha ke paas zikr hua ke Ibn Umar ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf marfu bayan kiya ke maiyat ko us ki qabr mein us ke ghar walon ke rone se azab diya jata hai. To unhon ne farmaya: Ibn Umar [Allah un par rehem farmaye] bhoole? Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne to farmaya: Beshak use us ki khata aur gunah se azab diya jata hai, jabke us ke ghar wale us par ab ro rahe hain. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ye us ke qaul jaisa hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) kunwein par khade hue jis mein Badr ke mushrik maqtool they. Phir Aap ne un se jo kaha kaha: Beshak wo sunte hain jo main kehta hun. Aap ne to farmaya: Beshak wo ab jante hain ke jo main un se kehta tha haq hai. Phir unhon ne parha [beshak tum murdon ko nahi sunate] aur [aur tum qabron walon ko sunane wale nahi]. Kehte hain jab wo Aag mein apni jagah le chuke hon."
"538","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ek Yahoodi aurat ke paas se guzre jis par us ke ghar wale ro rahe they. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak wo us par ro rahe hain jabke use us ki qabr mein azab diya ja raha hai."
"539","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate hue suna: Jis par noha kiya jaye use us noha se azab diya jata hai jo us par kiya jaye."
"540","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Haritha ke bete, Ja'far aur Ibn Rawaha ke qatl ki khabar aayi to Aap baithe jabke Aap mein gham pehchana jata tha. Aur main darwaze ke surakh se, darwaze ke shigaaf se dekh rahi thi. Phir Aap ke paas ek shakhs aaya aur arz kiya: Beshak Ja'far ki aurtein, aur un ke rone ka zikr kiya. To Aap ne use hukm diya ke unhe manع kare. Phir wo gaya. Phir doosri martaba Aap ke paas aaya ke unhon ne us ki itaat na ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Unhe manع karo. Phir teesri martaba Aap ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Allah ki qasam! Unhon ne hum par ghalba pa liya Ya Rasulullah! To unhon ne dawa kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: Phir un ke munhon mein mitti phenk do. Phir main ne kaha: Allah tumhari naak khaak-aalood kare. Tum ne wo na kiya jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhe hukm farmaya tha, aur tum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko takleef se na chhora."
"541","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne bai'at ke waqt hum se ahad liya ke hum noha nahi karenge. Phir hum mein se paanch aurton ke siwa kisi aurat ne wafa na ki: Umm Sulaim, Umm al-Ala, Abu Sabra ki beti jo Muadh ki biwi hain, aur do aurtein. Ya Abu Sabra ki beti, Muadh ki biwi aur ek aur aurat."
"542","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bai'at ki. Phir Aap ne hum par parha [ke wo Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karein]. Aur hamein noha se mana farmaya. Phir ek aurat ne apna hath rok liya aur arz kiya: Falan ne meri madad ki thi, main use badla dena chahti hun. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se kuchh na kaha. Phir wo gayi aur lauti aur Aap se bai'at ki."
"543","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein janazon ke peechhe chalne se mana kiya gaya, lekin hum par sakhti na ki gayi."
"544","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya al-Ansariya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas dakhil hue jab Aap ki beti faut ho gayi thein. To Aap ne farmaya: Use teen ya paanch ya is se zyada martaba ghusl do, agar tum aisa dekho, pani aur beri ke patton se. Aur aakhri mein kafoor ya kafoor mein se kuchh rakho. Phir jab tum farigh ho jao to mujhe khabar do. Phir jab hum ne Aap ko khabar di to Aap ne hamein apna tehband diya aur farmaya: Use isے pehnao, matlab apna tehband."
"545","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya al-Ansariya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hamare paas dakhil hue jab hum Aap ki beti ko ghusl de rahi thein. To Aap ne farmaya: Use teen ya paanch ya is se zyada martaba pani aur beri ke patton se ghusl do. Aur aakhri mein kafoor rakho. Phir jab tum farigh ho jao to mujhe khabar do. Phir jab hum farigh hue to hum ne Aap ko khabar di. Phir Aap ne hamari taraf apna tehband phenka aur farmaya: Use isے pehnao. Ayyub ne kaha [ek rawi]: Aur Hafsa ne mujhe Muhammad ki hadith jaisi bayan ki. Aur Hafsa ki hadith mein tha ke unhe taaq ghusl do. Us mein tha teen ya paanch ya saat. Aur us mein tha ke Aap ne farmaya: Un ke dayan se aur un mein wuzu ki jaghon se ibtida karo. Aur us mein tha ke Umm Atiyya ne kaha: Aur hum ne un ke teen jode banaye."
"546","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki beti ko ghusl diya to Aap ne hum se farmaya, jab hum use ghusl de rahi thein: Un ke dayan se aur un mein wuzu ki jaghon se ibtida karo."
"547","[AI-translation] Hazrat Khabbab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath hijrat ki, Allah ka chehra talash karte hue. Phir hamara ajr Allah par waqe hua. Phir hum mein se jo mar gaya us ne apne ajr mein se kuchh na khaya. Un mein Mus'ab bin Umair hain. Aur hum mein se jis ka phal pak gaya to wo use todta hai. Wo Uhud ke din qatl hue. Phir hum ne kafan ke liye chadar ke siwa kuchh na paya. Jab hum us se un ka sar dhankte to un ke paon nikal aate, aur jab un ke paon dhankte to un ka sar nikal aata. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke hum un ka sar dhanpein aur un ke paon par izkhir mein se rakhein."
"548","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Yemeni safed sahuli rui ke teen kapdon mein kafan diya gaya, un mein qamees aur amama na tha."
"549","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) jab faut hue to Aap ko dharidar chadar odhayi gayi."
"550","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Janaze mein jaldi karo. Phir agar wo nek ho to bhalayi hai jise tum aage badhate ho. Aur agar is ke siwa ho to burayi hai jise tum apni gardanon se utarte ho."
"551","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo janaze mein hazir ho yahan tak ke us par namaz parhe to us ke liye ek qirat hai. Aur jo hazir ho yahan tak ke dafan kiya jaye to us ke liye do qirat hain. Arz kiya gaya: Do qirat kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Do bade pahadon jaisa."
"552","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Aisha se riwayat hai, Ibn Umar ne bayan kiya ke Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Jo janaze ke peechhe chale to us ke liye ek qirat hai. To unhon ne kaha: Abu Hurairah ne hum par kasrat ki. Phir tasdeeq ki, matlab Aisha ne Abu Hurairah ki. Aur unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye farmate suna. Phir Ibn Umar ne kaha: Beshak hum ne bahut se qirat zaya kiye."
"553","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Log ek janaze ke paas se guzre aur us ki achhayi ki tareef ki. To Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wajib ho gayi. Phir doosre ke paas se guzre aur us ki burayi ki tareef ki. To Aap ne farmaya: Wajib ho gayi. Phir Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) ne arz kiya: Kya wajib hui? Aap ne farmaya: Is ki tum ne achhayi ki tareef ki to us ke liye Jannat wajib ho gayi. Aur is ki tum ne burayi ki tareef ki to us ke liye Dozakh wajib ho gayi. Tum zameen mein Allah ke gawah ho."
"554","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatada bin Rib'i al-Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas se ek janaza guzara gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: Aaram pane wala aur jis se aaram paya jaye. Unhon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Aaram pane wala aur jis se aaram paya jaye kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Momin banda duniya ki thakan aur takleef se Allah ki rehmat ki taraf aaram pata hai. Aur fajir banda, us se bande, sheher, darakht aur janwar aaram pate hain."
"555","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah ne Najashi ki us din khabar di jis din wo mare. Aap Eidgah ki taraf nikle aur unhe saf bandhi aur chaar takbeerein kahein."
"556","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein Najashi, Habsha ke badshah ki, us din khabar di jis din wo mare. To Aap ne farmaya: Apne bhai ke liye maghfirat mango."
"557","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Ashama Najashi par namaz parhi aur chaar takbeerein kahein."
"558","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Aaj Habsha mein se ek nek mard faut hua hai. To aao aur us par namaz parho. Unhon ne kaha: Phir hum ne saf bandhi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us par namaz parhi jabke hum safein they."
"559","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas se Sulaiman al-Shaibani ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Sha'bi ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe us ne khabar di jo Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath ek alag thalag qabr par guzra. Phir Aap ne un ki imamat ki aur wo us par saf bandhe. Phir main ne kaha: Ae Abu Amr! Tumhe kis ne bayan kiya? To unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas ne."
"560","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek siyah mard ya aurat masjid mein jhadu deta tha. Phir wo mar gaya, aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us ki maut ka ilm na hua. Phir Aap ne ek din us ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Us insan ka kya hua? Unhon ne arz kiya: Wo mar gaya Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ne mujhe khabar na di? To unhon ne kaha: Wo aisa aur aisa tha, us ka qissa. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne us ki shan ko haqeer samjha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir mujhe us ki qabr par le chalo. Phir Aap us ki qabr par aaye aur us par namaz parhi."
"561","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amir bin Rabi'a (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to khade ho jao yahan tak ke wo tumhe peechhe chhor de."
"562","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amir bin Rabi'a (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi janaza dekhe, phir agar wo us ke sath chalne wala na ho to use chahiye ke khada rahe yahan tak ke wo use peechhe chhor de ya wo use peechhe chhor de ya us ke peechhe chhorne se pehle rakh diya jaye."
"563","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to khade ho jao. Phir jo us ke peechhe chale wo na baithe yahan tak ke wo rakh diya jaye."
"564","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamare paas se ek janaza guzra. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke liye khade ho gaye, aur hum Aap ke sath khade ho gaye. Phir hum ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak ye Yahoodi ka janaza hai. Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum janaza dekho to khade ho jao."
"565","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sahl bin Hunaif aur Qais bin Sa'd se Abd al-Rahman bin Abi Laila ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sahl bin Hunaif aur Qais bin Sa'd Qadisiya mein baithe they. Phir un ke paas se ek janaza guzara gaya to wo dono khade ho gaye. Phir un se kaha gaya: Beshak ye zameen walon mein se hai, matlab zimmi walon mein se. To un dono ne kaha: Beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas se ek janaza guzra to Aap khade ho gaye. Phir Aap se kaha gaya: Beshak ye Yahoodi ka janaza hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo ek jaan nahi?"
"566","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samura bin Jundub (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke peechhe ek aurat par namaz parhi jo nifas mein faut hui thi. Phir Aap us par darmiyan mein khade hue."
